'''Togeluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] gacha events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]] grants much higher health, faster attack rate, many more knockbacks and strengthens at 99% HP instead of 1%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

