==Trivia==
*"Toge" in Japanese can mean splinter or spine, which explains the many protruding spikes on Togeluga's body.
*This is one of the only cats that has more health in its Normal Form than in its Evolved Form.
**Their Evolved Form has the lowest health among all non-collab [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]].
**Their True Form is tied with [[Legeluga (Legend Rare Cat)|Legelan Pasalan]] as the highest health among all Lugas.
*Togelan Pasalan's and Shishilan Pasalan's descriptions say "he"; however, in the gacha event's former description, it referred to them as "she".
*Prior to [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], Togelan Pasalan was not immune to waves.
*Shishilan Pasalan is a reference to the [[wikia:ghibli:Forest Spirit|Night Walker]] from the movie ''[[wikipedia:Princess Mononoke|Princess Mononoke]],'' also known as a ''Shishigami'', explaining the first part of Shishilan's name. In addition to looking similar, both are described as gods of life and death.

